WEBVTT

01:33.251 --> 01:36.005
(Fireworks of My Heart)

01:36.105 --> 01:37.907
(Adapted from the novel "A City, Waiting for You" by Jiuyuexi)

01:38.007 --> 01:40.810
(Episode 8)

01:42.011 --> 01:44.089
(We got a suicide jumper at No.13 Shuiyang Street.)

01:44.403 --> 01:46.422
(We got a suicide jumper at No.13 Shuiyang Street.)

02:17.813 --> 02:18.848
I'll brief you of the situation.

02:18.933 --> 02:21.736
A young girl lost her job and had an argument with her parents.

02:21.817 --> 02:24.497
She's attempting suicide now. She's in a very tense emotional state.

02:25.708 --> 02:27.568
Our officer is trying to get her to come down.

02:27.989 --> 02:28.989
There she is.

02:29.683 --> 02:31.029
Will you please come down first?

02:31.293 --> 02:33.313
Stay away! If you come closer, I'll jump.

02:33.629 --> 02:35.555
Yang Chi, take care of the ground. I'll go up.

02:35.636 --> 02:37.465
Instructor, let me go up instead. You stay here.

02:37.528 --> 02:38.528
This is an order.

02:39.203 --> 02:40.603
Jiang Yi, Jun Ping, come with me.

02:40.683 --> 02:41.683
Yes, sir.

02:43.539 --> 02:45.165
Lay the air cushion, set up cordon. Now!

02:55.562 --> 02:56.562
Girl,

02:56.722 --> 02:58.028
will you please come down first?

02:58.282 --> 03:00.243
Go away. Don't come any closer, or I will jump.

03:01.243 --> 03:02.243
Don't move.

03:02.825 --> 03:03.825
Listen to me.

03:05.107 --> 03:07.568
You are still young. You have a whole life ahead of you.

03:08.282 --> 03:10.683
-Back off! Or I will jump! -Okay! Okay!

03:11.710 --> 03:12.710
Okay. Okay.

03:15.843 --> 03:17.562
I will stay here, I promise.

03:18.068 --> 03:19.241
You have to stay there too.

03:19.722 --> 03:20.722
Girl,

03:21.944 --> 03:23.610
where you are standing is too dangerous.

03:24.513 --> 03:26.060
Let's get out of there and talk to us.

03:26.583 --> 03:28.303
Even if I die, no one cares.

03:28.842 --> 03:29.842
Why would you think that?

03:31.123 --> 03:32.162
You're still so young.

03:32.955 --> 03:33.955
If you have any problems,

03:34.936 --> 03:35.936
I'll solve them with you,

03:36.328 --> 03:37.328
okay?

03:42.441 --> 03:44.442
Come, have some water first.

03:44.567 --> 03:45.567
No.

03:47.868 --> 03:50.668
You can't solve my problem.

03:50.955 --> 03:52.474
You can always find another job.

03:52.843 --> 03:55.722
You don't understand, none of you understand!

03:56.322 --> 03:58.115
I've worked really hard.

03:58.180 --> 03:59.701
Really, really hard.

04:01.243 --> 04:04.482
My boss is a rascal, a scumbag!

04:05.521 --> 04:09.122
He ruined everything for me.

04:11.482 --> 04:13.362
That's even more reason for you to keep going.

04:14.929 --> 04:15.929
Girl,

04:16.465 --> 04:17.465
if you were bullied,

04:18.034 --> 04:19.274
I'll go to the police with you.

04:19.376 --> 04:20.902
I'll make sure you get justice,

04:21.136 --> 04:22.136
okay?

04:22.196 --> 04:25.922
I won't get justice anymore. I lost the evidence.

04:26.602 --> 04:28.763
My parents even scolded me.

04:29.162 --> 04:31.282
They said I can't do anything right,

04:32.048 --> 04:34.287
that I lost my job, and I'm useless.

04:34.929 --> 04:37.449
All they ever do is rebuking me.

04:37.953 --> 04:40.108
Ever since I was little, no matter what happens,

04:40.189 --> 04:43.078
it's always my fault. My fault!

04:43.159 --> 04:45.118
I'm a mistake!

04:45.883 --> 04:47.751
Since they want me dead, I'll do as they wish!

04:47.830 --> 04:49.790
No! No!

04:52.549 --> 04:54.469
No. Don't jump.

04:54.922 --> 04:55.922
Don't jump.

04:56.338 --> 04:57.338
Don't jump.

05:04.080 --> 05:05.080
Don't jump.

05:07.016 --> 05:08.016
Don't jump.

05:09.603 --> 05:10.603
Girl,

05:11.821 --> 05:12.821
trust me.

05:13.903 --> 05:15.903
I'm sure things are not how you think they are.

05:16.695 --> 05:17.695
They can't be.

05:24.802 --> 05:25.961
Actually, I'm just like you.

05:28.002 --> 05:29.248
I've never received approval

05:30.506 --> 05:32.466
from my parents since I was little.

05:35.669 --> 05:36.822
My dad not only scolded me,

05:37.642 --> 05:38.642
but he also hit me.

05:39.523 --> 05:40.689
I used to hate them so much.

05:41.601 --> 05:42.601
But later,

05:42.808 --> 05:43.848
I eventually realized

05:45.923 --> 05:47.563
that our parents do love us.

05:48.858 --> 05:50.738
It's just that they have their limitations too.

05:51.661 --> 05:53.662
It's very likely

05:54.230 --> 05:56.756
that they themselves were not treated well by their own parents.

05:57.082 --> 05:58.843
They do what they do out of concern

05:58.924 --> 05:59.924
and care for us.

06:01.604 --> 06:03.443
But they don't know how to express love.

06:05.007 --> 06:06.716
That's why their words come out as harsh.

06:07.795 --> 06:10.378
It becomes verbal abuse to your ears, right?

06:11.900 --> 06:16.601
There are no parents who don't love their children, right?

06:17.687 --> 06:18.687
Here.

06:19.523 --> 06:20.523
Have some water first.

06:20.643 --> 06:21.643
Here.

06:24.393 --> 06:25.393
You should have it.

06:27.496 --> 06:28.496
You should have it.

06:47.817 --> 06:48.817
Girl,

06:49.985 --> 06:52.521
you can distance yourself from people and jobs you don't like,

06:52.602 --> 06:53.602
including your parents.

06:54.742 --> 06:55.742
You can move out.

06:56.722 --> 06:58.268
You can move to another city.

06:59.376 --> 07:01.495
If you don't want to see certain people, you don't have to. It's okay.

07:01.576 --> 07:02.576
You're still so young.

07:03.265 --> 07:04.892
Your future holds endless possibilities,

07:05.534 --> 07:06.534
right?

07:13.802 --> 07:14.882
You've been standing there

07:15.435 --> 07:16.435
for too long.

07:16.846 --> 07:17.846
Aren't you tired?

07:18.482 --> 07:20.482
Let's come up for a moment, okay?

07:23.482 --> 07:25.482
Come, come.

07:28.482 --> 07:29.482
Come.

07:31.963 --> 07:33.183
Do you think she will jump?

07:33.922 --> 07:34.922
Who knows?

07:35.898 --> 07:37.268
Maybe she's just putting an act.

07:37.742 --> 07:40.242
Stop saying such insensitive things.

07:40.482 --> 07:42.642
She wants to kill herself just because she had a fight with her family.

07:42.772 --> 07:44.384
Someone like her is a waste of existence.

07:44.482 --> 07:45.802
How could you say that?

07:45.941 --> 07:47.128
What are you talking about?

07:47.209 --> 07:48.209
How could you say that?

07:48.602 --> 07:50.242
Kids like her are the worst.

07:50.312 --> 07:52.045
She's going against her family on purpose.

07:52.802 --> 07:54.782
She shouldn't have been born in the first place.

08:11.267 --> 08:12.267
Sir,

08:13.369 --> 08:14.369
thank you.

08:16.105 --> 08:17.105
I'm sorry.

08:17.523 --> 08:18.523
No!

08:23.242 --> 08:24.242
Instructor!

08:29.362 --> 08:30.362
Yang Chi,

08:30.602 --> 08:32.202
I'll lower the rope. Catch Instructor.

08:32.282 --> 08:35.443
Okay. Lower Instructor down slowly. Aim the air cushion.

08:51.083 --> 08:52.083
Catch him!

08:52.283 --> 08:54.163
He's landed. Safe.

09:01.002 --> 09:02.917
-Take her to the hospital. -Got it.

09:03.923 --> 09:05.843
Are you okay? You okay?

09:06.563 --> 09:08.803
Who said that just now? Are you even human?

09:17.700 --> 09:18.740
That is a life.

09:20.443 --> 09:21.722
A life!

09:24.163 --> 09:25.163
Who among you

09:26.002 --> 09:27.283
has never felt lost?

09:28.678 --> 09:30.438
Who among you has never faced difficulties?

09:36.185 --> 09:37.518
If the person standing up there

09:38.662 --> 09:40.542
was your family member, loved one, or child,

09:41.369 --> 09:42.688
would you still be able

09:43.283 --> 09:44.843
to look at it as a joke?

09:46.136 --> 09:47.136
Could you?

09:59.075 --> 10:00.075
Instructor,

10:00.203 --> 10:01.203
are you okay?

10:02.178 --> 10:03.178
Jun... Jun...

10:15.808 --> 10:18.493
(Yancheng University)

10:24.600 --> 10:25.600
Zhai Miao.

10:29.323 --> 10:30.803
How are you now? Are you okay?

10:32.240 --> 10:35.313
If it wasn't for my brother, I'd probably still be in the police station.

10:35.483 --> 10:36.923
You've suffered.

10:38.163 --> 10:39.934
-Then... -Don't worry.

10:40.015 --> 10:42.375
No matter what happened to me, I would never give you away.

10:45.154 --> 10:46.154
I'm sorry.

10:46.762 --> 10:49.108
I really didn't know that they gave me counterfeit goods.

10:49.558 --> 10:51.876
It's okay. It's not your fault anyway.

10:52.084 --> 10:54.644
Although I bought the goods from you, you are also a victim.

10:55.398 --> 10:56.398
Speaking of which,

10:57.963 --> 10:58.963
take a look at this.

11:02.223 --> 11:03.921
(Total intake) (Penalty total)

11:04.040 --> 11:05.040
So much!

11:05.507 --> 11:07.043
The money used for buying the goods

11:07.122 --> 11:08.242
and the fines.

11:14.049 --> 11:15.083
Don't worry.

11:15.151 --> 11:16.391
I won't ask you to pay for it.

11:16.786 --> 11:18.907
However, we need to find a quick way to make money.

11:19.203 --> 11:20.656
My brother paid the fines for me.

11:20.856 --> 11:22.091
That's his hard-earned money.

11:22.156 --> 11:23.896
I have to pay him back as soon as possible.

11:26.242 --> 11:28.249
Okay, we will repay him together.

12:17.813 --> 12:18.813
Let's talk.

12:31.722 --> 12:32.882
I spoke without thinking

12:33.162 --> 12:34.162
that day.

12:34.964 --> 12:36.204
I said things too harshly.

12:38.014 --> 12:39.055
I didn't give you a chance

12:39.803 --> 12:40.803
to express

12:41.389 --> 12:42.389
your thoughts properly.

12:47.443 --> 12:48.443
I'm sorry.

12:54.383 --> 12:55.856
I'm the one who should apologize.

12:57.352 --> 13:00.048
I should have discussed this with you in the first place.

13:00.701 --> 13:02.068
With our relationship,

13:03.041 --> 13:04.488
I shouldn't have kept it from you.

13:04.916 --> 13:06.276
I should be the one apologizing.

13:07.262 --> 13:08.798
I wasn't thinking straight that day.

13:08.864 --> 13:10.404
I thought you were only after money.

13:11.700 --> 13:13.801
But deep down, I didn't actually think that way.

13:13.882 --> 13:15.182
Somehow, it just led there.

13:16.163 --> 13:17.281
And I just blurted it out.

13:17.362 --> 13:19.002
I knew you didn't think that way

13:20.722 --> 13:22.482
Do you know what 1,200 yuan means to me?

13:24.722 --> 13:25.722
It means

13:27.350 --> 13:28.909
I can better support my parents.

13:29.923 --> 13:32.243
It means I can stop being in a long-distance relationship.

13:33.010 --> 13:34.323
For the past five or six years,

13:34.857 --> 13:36.617
I've been away from home most of the time.

13:36.870 --> 13:37.910
My father just had surgery

13:38.482 --> 13:39.695
and his health isn't good.

13:40.190 --> 13:41.556
He has difficulty moving around.

13:42.198 --> 13:43.822
My fiancee has been taking care of him.

13:44.402 --> 13:45.402
For so many years,

13:46.168 --> 13:48.069
we've been in a relationship without an official status.

13:48.150 --> 13:49.769
She has been worrying about me too much.

13:50.482 --> 13:51.803
I can't keep holding her back.

13:52.608 --> 13:54.128
So this is the reality I have to face.

13:55.841 --> 13:56.841
What about you?

13:57.023 --> 13:58.449
What are your plans for the future?

14:05.482 --> 14:06.722
Since joining this team,

14:08.444 --> 14:10.770
I haven't had the energy to think about anything else.

14:11.729 --> 14:12.729
But recently,

14:13.970 --> 14:14.970
I don't know why,

14:15.922 --> 14:17.311
I keep thinking about the past.

14:20.362 --> 14:21.362
Back then...

14:26.818 --> 14:29.078
Well, it seems to have nothing to do with the present.

14:30.112 --> 14:31.112
Honestly,

14:31.996 --> 14:33.395
I don't know if the future me

14:34.183 --> 14:35.962
will have any connection with the present.

14:37.795 --> 14:38.795
But

14:39.909 --> 14:40.909
I hope there will be.

14:41.323 --> 14:43.003
Otherwise, I'll be like a kite

14:43.308 --> 14:44.308
flying high,

14:45.127 --> 14:46.714
but not knowing where the thread is.

14:48.597 --> 14:49.928
There will be a connection.

14:50.242 --> 14:51.702
After all, we're not machines.

14:52.203 --> 14:54.515
Who doesn't have moments of confusion and uncertainty?

14:57.406 --> 14:58.406
Listen to me,

14:59.663 --> 15:00.982
my friend,

15:01.782 --> 15:03.063
do your job well,

15:04.635 --> 15:06.108
but it's also time to settle down.

15:24.043 --> 15:25.043
I've been wondering

15:28.402 --> 15:29.843
if I would be living

15:31.741 --> 15:32.861
all alone in the future.

15:35.810 --> 15:37.123
Coming back to an empty house

15:38.241 --> 15:39.841
without anyone waiting for me.

15:45.087 --> 15:46.087
There will be someone.

15:47.242 --> 15:48.582
There will definitely be someone.

15:59.402 --> 16:00.581
Hold on, why did the subject

16:00.836 --> 16:03.028
of our conversation suddenly shift to me?

16:08.878 --> 16:09.878
Suo Jun,

16:10.208 --> 16:11.328
no matter where you go

16:11.963 --> 16:13.083
or what decisions you make,

16:14.203 --> 16:15.749
you will always be my closest comrade,

16:17.319 --> 16:18.439
my closest buddy.

16:28.197 --> 16:29.197
Don't worry.

16:30.076 --> 16:31.076
No matter where I am,

16:32.775 --> 16:33.928
no matter what place I'm in,

16:35.683 --> 16:37.309
I will always be a soldier of Shili Tai.

17:03.148 --> 17:04.148
Song Yan,

17:04.956 --> 17:06.315
when it comes to work,

17:06.769 --> 17:08.182
I'm not worried about you at all.

17:08.922 --> 17:10.422
You always know what you are doing.

17:10.806 --> 17:12.492
But when it comes to your personal life,

17:13.109 --> 17:14.449
don't keep suppressing yourself.

17:15.042 --> 17:16.441
Do what you truly desire.

17:17.313 --> 17:18.313
Cherish the present.

17:20.642 --> 17:21.642
I'm fine.

17:22.585 --> 17:24.344
Actually, I can't wait for you to leave.

17:24.695 --> 17:26.868
Then, I won't have to listen to your nagging anymore.

17:28.208 --> 17:29.329
I know you don't mean that.

17:30.493 --> 17:33.519
So, were all those talks about wanting me to stay just lies?

17:34.416 --> 17:35.656
I was just being polite.

17:36.243 --> 17:37.243
Don't take it seriously.

17:38.402 --> 17:39.402
Don't worry.

17:40.168 --> 17:41.437
There will be a new guy coming soon.

17:41.529 --> 17:43.315
The next guy will be more obedient than you.

17:44.362 --> 17:45.602
You should improve

17:45.775 --> 17:47.101
your grumpy temperament now.

17:47.228 --> 17:48.589
Don't get into an argument

17:48.843 --> 17:49.843
with the new instructor.

17:50.043 --> 17:51.043
Don't worry.

17:51.734 --> 17:52.774
I always

17:53.082 --> 17:54.443
favour a new friend.

17:56.196 --> 17:57.196
What?

17:57.723 --> 18:00.096
Am I supposed to wish you a pleasant cooperation with him?

18:02.825 --> 18:04.784
Someone sounds jealous.

18:53.209 --> 18:54.409
(Hi, )

18:54.636 --> 18:55.636
(Mr. Firefighter.)

18:56.283 --> 18:58.803
(I'm the girl who jumped off a building and you saved me.)

18:59.882 --> 19:01.208
(Thank you for saving my life.)

19:02.563 --> 19:03.563
(Until today, )

19:04.204 --> 19:06.010
(I felt that this world was utterly awful.)

19:06.803 --> 19:08.703
(I couldn't find the courage to go on living, )

19:09.324 --> 19:12.203
(but when you selflessly jumped down and held onto me, )

19:12.916 --> 19:13.916
(I realized)

19:14.715 --> 19:16.235
(that there is light in this world.)

19:17.533 --> 19:19.133
(There are people who care about me, )

19:19.268 --> 19:20.389
(who will protect me.)

19:22.476 --> 19:23.476
(From now on, )

19:23.638 --> 19:24.726
(when I encounter difficulties, )

19:24.807 --> 19:26.966
(I won't resort to extreme measures anymore.)

19:27.442 --> 19:29.843
(I will cherish the second chance at life you've given me.)

19:30.681 --> 19:31.721
(I will live well.)

20:10.389 --> 20:11.702
(Yuan Yuan)

20:23.866 --> 20:25.734
-Hello. -So,

20:27.162 --> 20:28.682
can you give me another year?

20:29.722 --> 20:30.722
(I promise, )

20:30.869 --> 20:31.869
(a year later, )

20:32.535 --> 20:33.535
(I will go back)

20:34.710 --> 20:35.710
to you,

20:36.182 --> 20:37.182
to my parents.

20:39.122 --> 20:40.122
(Suo Jun, )

20:40.636 --> 20:41.636
(we're done.)

20:42.402 --> 20:44.003
You still love your career more.

20:45.096 --> 20:46.376
You love your job more.

20:47.962 --> 20:50.402
(I don't want to wait for you year after year anymore.)

20:52.728 --> 20:54.728
(Don't ever call me again.)

21:51.587 --> 21:52.587
Captain Song,

21:52.870 --> 21:53.870
long time no see.

21:56.869 --> 21:57.869
What's the matter?

21:58.559 --> 22:00.588
I lodged a complaint against you openly last time.

22:00.669 --> 22:02.495
Are you still holding a grudge after all this time?

22:02.576 --> 22:03.855
I'm not thinking about you.

22:04.142 --> 22:05.142
Don't be dramatic.

22:06.402 --> 22:07.402
Rise!

22:14.682 --> 22:15.682
Sit!

22:15.762 --> 22:17.643
(Yanbei Firefighting Detachment)

22:17.780 --> 22:18.780
Comrades,

22:19.642 --> 22:20.723
it's not easy

22:20.882 --> 22:22.323
to gather

22:22.703 --> 22:24.023
all of you frontline instructors

22:24.783 --> 22:25.783
here today.

22:27.201 --> 22:28.201
On ordinary days,

22:28.268 --> 22:29.949
at the scene of firefighting and rescue,

22:30.483 --> 22:32.389
people praise each and every one of you

22:32.582 --> 22:34.382
as little tigers.

22:34.843 --> 22:36.083
But I believe

22:36.682 --> 22:37.682
being just tigers

22:38.167 --> 22:39.167
is not enough.

22:39.529 --> 22:41.689
I need you to become tigers with wings.

22:42.170 --> 22:43.272
So, today,

22:43.340 --> 22:45.523
I am going to give you a pair of wings.

22:45.922 --> 22:46.922
What wings?

22:47.876 --> 22:48.876
Theory

22:49.156 --> 22:50.156
and technology.

22:50.579 --> 22:52.619
Today, I have invited

22:52.914 --> 22:54.561
a talented individual from our system,

22:54.642 --> 22:56.955
a high-achieving student from University of Science and Technology,

22:57.036 --> 22:58.036
Jiang Yu.

22:59.121 --> 23:00.815
He will talk to us about technology

23:01.209 --> 23:02.369
and theory.

23:02.929 --> 23:04.415
Let's give him a round of applause!

23:14.003 --> 23:15.843
Hi, everyone. I'm Jiang Yu.

23:18.843 --> 23:20.549
This guy's got an impressive background.

23:24.613 --> 23:26.412
What you are seeing here

23:26.483 --> 23:28.702
is something called Super Battle Helmet.

23:28.783 --> 23:31.003
It has a built-in computer module

23:31.156 --> 23:33.243
and a high-temperature capture camera.

23:33.554 --> 23:35.510
It presents information to firefighters through

23:35.590 --> 23:37.144
a specially designed augmented reality screen.

23:37.225 --> 23:39.763
This is a video that was released recently.

23:41.602 --> 23:43.682
It's called the Bipedal Robot.

23:44.633 --> 23:45.992
It can walk just like

23:46.443 --> 23:47.443
a human.

23:47.487 --> 23:49.224
It is equipped with a laser radar

23:49.305 --> 23:51.505
that can detect dense smoke and flames.

23:52.375 --> 23:53.734
In recent years, there has been

23:53.975 --> 23:56.342
significant investment in technology within the firefighting system.

23:56.389 --> 23:58.362
So, I believe that in the near future,

23:58.575 --> 24:00.074
it can replace firefighters

24:00.155 --> 24:01.595
and enter the fire scene,

24:01.942 --> 24:03.103
reducing our casualties.

24:06.889 --> 24:08.129
That's impractical.

24:11.702 --> 24:13.222
What frontline firefighting units

24:13.562 --> 24:14.762
need now are not robots

24:15.389 --> 24:16.935
but retaining experienced personnel.

24:17.932 --> 24:19.335
I don't think there is a conflict

24:19.416 --> 24:22.236
between training experienced people and improving technology.

24:22.563 --> 24:23.563
Advancing technology

24:23.604 --> 24:25.897
can help solve problems more quickly and efficiently.

24:26.742 --> 24:27.782
Advanced technology

24:28.069 --> 24:29.069
is great,

24:29.342 --> 24:30.342
and I agree with that.

24:31.261 --> 24:33.881
The foreign advanced technologies you mentioned are not wrong,

24:34.182 --> 24:35.885
but you should also understand

24:35.968 --> 24:37.839
the practical situation at the grassroots level.

24:37.920 --> 24:39.881
I know that reform is not an overnight process,

24:40.543 --> 24:41.623
but as long as it starts,

24:42.042 --> 24:43.042
there will be hope.

24:43.825 --> 24:45.569
I believe technology can solve

24:45.661 --> 24:47.501
many disputes unrelated to technology.

24:47.981 --> 24:48.981
Say in a fire scene,

24:49.497 --> 24:51.442
there's a little girl in the room on the left,

24:51.876 --> 24:53.275
and her mother is in the room on the right.

24:54.116 --> 24:55.275
Can your technology tell me

24:55.915 --> 24:56.915
which one to save?

24:57.238 --> 24:59.241
This depends on the situation at the scene

24:59.440 --> 25:00.843
and requires prediction and analysis.

25:00.929 --> 25:02.409
I don't need prediction and analysis.

25:03.162 --> 25:04.162
I'll save both.

25:04.714 --> 25:06.140
As long as I strengthen my training

25:06.455 --> 25:08.096
and enhance my personal skills,

25:08.749 --> 25:10.896
maybe I can save them both.

25:11.921 --> 25:14.214
Improving technological level is certainly important,

25:14.376 --> 25:16.140
but we must not overlook people's abilities.

25:16.409 --> 25:17.409
Machines

25:17.903 --> 25:18.903
only follow commands

25:19.729 --> 25:21.049
and complete expected tasks,

25:22.442 --> 25:23.442
but human

25:24.567 --> 25:25.847
will can create miracles.

25:26.535 --> 25:27.535
Well said!

25:40.082 --> 25:41.082
Captain Song.

25:41.849 --> 25:43.181
I'd like to add you friend on WeChat.

25:43.262 --> 25:45.202
There is something I'd like to discuss with you.

25:45.486 --> 25:47.223
I'm stationed in Shili Tai Station.

25:47.289 --> 25:49.869
If you really want to ask me something, you can find me there.

25:53.596 --> 25:54.596
Captain Song...

25:57.916 --> 25:58.916
Here's a reminder.

25:59.162 --> 26:00.922
-Steer clear of him. -Why?

26:01.132 --> 26:02.962
He's notorious for being argumentative.

26:03.278 --> 26:04.504
He's not a guy to mess with.

26:04.672 --> 26:05.808
But I find him interesting.

26:07.677 --> 26:08.677
Good luck.

26:16.752 --> 26:17.752
Come in.

26:23.763 --> 26:26.962
Catching you is like catching a monkey most of the times.

26:27.323 --> 26:29.369
Everyone has already left, why are you still here?

26:32.202 --> 26:33.202
Captain Gao,

26:33.642 --> 26:35.283
I'd like to talk to you about Suo Jun.

26:35.938 --> 26:36.938
What about him?

26:37.162 --> 26:38.675
It's about his transfer application.

26:39.196 --> 26:40.196
Just approve it.

26:42.330 --> 26:43.743
You don't have to worry about me.

26:43.846 --> 26:45.206
I have no objections here.

26:45.602 --> 26:48.003
Look, why do we work so hard?

26:48.700 --> 26:51.003
Isn't it to ensure the safety of thousands of households?

26:51.620 --> 26:54.499
You see, we firefighters have to protect our own families too.

26:55.508 --> 26:58.188
Suo Jun's fiancee and parents

26:59.462 --> 27:00.462
are relying on him.

27:00.863 --> 27:01.896
About this application,

27:01.941 --> 27:03.021
don't let it stuck here.

27:03.541 --> 27:04.541
Just approve it.

27:05.533 --> 27:07.476
What transfer application are you talking about?

27:07.770 --> 27:08.770
Suo Jun's application.

27:09.942 --> 27:12.416
-Didn't he give it to you? -He never gave it to me at all.

27:27.922 --> 27:28.991
Please stop taking photos.

27:29.083 --> 27:31.402
Hurry up, please stand back.

27:33.523 --> 27:34.563
It's so dangerous.

27:35.162 --> 27:36.723
The firefighters rescued another one.

27:43.442 --> 27:44.442
Doctor!

28:23.763 --> 28:24.803
(Requesting backup!)

28:25.003 --> 28:26.122
(Requesting backup!)

28:44.763 --> 28:46.843
Instructor... Instructor is still inside!

28:48.962 --> 28:49.962
Doctor!

28:50.439 --> 28:51.439
Doctor!

28:53.801 --> 28:54.801
Instructor!

28:55.122 --> 28:56.202
Instructor!

29:25.642 --> 29:27.243
-Thanks. -Drive slowly.

29:54.563 --> 29:55.723
Don't worry. He's saved.

29:56.162 --> 29:57.162
But...

29:57.882 --> 29:58.882
But

29:59.175 --> 30:00.441
his arm can't be used anymore.

32:16.645 --> 32:17.645
You're awake.

32:20.627 --> 32:22.347
Why are you wearing a sad face?

32:27.803 --> 32:29.323
Did Captain Gao scold you again?

32:37.523 --> 32:39.043
You are worried about me.

32:46.375 --> 32:47.774
I'm fine,

32:49.856 --> 32:50.896
really.

32:54.243 --> 32:56.083
I didn't break any arms or legs.

32:57.229 --> 32:58.629
I'll recuperate and recover.

33:04.243 --> 33:05.402
You will be fine.

33:08.362 --> 33:09.722
Don't wear a sad face anymore.

33:12.501 --> 33:13.501
Smile a little.

33:21.110 --> 33:22.236
I'll go get you the doctor.

34:03.753 --> 34:04.753
You know,

34:05.156 --> 34:06.156
if I get transferred,

34:06.682 --> 34:08.563
I will get paid 1200 yuan more there.

34:09.283 --> 34:11.272
-I can... -You are after the money?

34:12.042 --> 34:14.843
Do you still remember the vow we made when we formed our team?

34:15.455 --> 34:16.827
You have forgotten all about it.

34:17.323 --> 34:19.763
You have abandoned your responsibilities and mission.

34:21.270 --> 34:22.270
You are

34:22.802 --> 34:23.962
a deserter!

34:37.253 --> 34:39.253
We both made a vow.

34:40.154 --> 34:41.214
Do you remember?

34:45.192 --> 34:48.202
We will turn Shili Tai Station into the best fire station in the country.

34:49.002 --> 34:51.186
What transfer application are you talking about?

34:51.267 --> 34:52.867
He never gave it to me at all.

35:10.731 --> 35:14.711
(Bed 25, Suo Jun)

35:15.558 --> 35:17.558
(Name: Chen Min) (Dietary: Keep it bland)

35:40.747 --> 35:43.134
The patient is in a state of mild coma, showing signs of awakening.

35:43.215 --> 35:44.215
Please observe closely.

36:02.949 --> 36:04.028
This is Chen Min?

36:05.241 --> 36:06.241
Look,

36:06.475 --> 36:08.455
Chen Min looked so beautiful before the accident.

36:09.148 --> 36:10.548
She was beautiful.

36:11.380 --> 36:13.019
What is she going to do after this?

36:14.555 --> 36:15.595
Who knows?

36:16.390 --> 36:17.870
She's severely injured.

36:18.487 --> 36:20.447
The burn area covers 16% of her body.

36:20.654 --> 36:22.255
All her fingers are stuck together.

36:22.522 --> 36:23.763
She will need another surgery.

36:25.261 --> 36:27.140
She was such a beautiful girl.

36:28.203 --> 36:29.335
It's such a pity.

37:59.221 --> 38:00.580
Did we get the girl out?

38:05.316 --> 38:06.316
Yes.

38:07.163 --> 38:08.163
That's good.

38:09.455 --> 38:10.455
That's good.

38:16.614 --> 38:17.614
I went to the detachment.

38:20.055 --> 38:21.561
You didn't submit the application.

38:24.246 --> 38:25.246
It's all my fault.

38:35.442 --> 38:36.763
How is this your fault?

38:39.163 --> 38:40.482
It was my own decision.

38:43.733 --> 38:44.733
I wanted to

38:46.443 --> 38:47.923
stay with you for another year.

38:50.396 --> 38:51.595
But now it looks like

38:53.643 --> 38:54.836
I don't have another choice.

38:58.703 --> 38:59.703
It's all my fault.

39:00.549 --> 39:02.149
I shouldn't have gone to the meeting.

39:02.649 --> 39:05.371
I should've gone on the mission myself. I shouldn't have let you go.

39:05.452 --> 39:07.345
And this wouldn't have happened to you.

39:07.716 --> 39:08.716
It's all my fault.

39:12.364 --> 39:13.389
Song Yan.

39:13.936 --> 39:14.936
Song Yan,

39:15.431 --> 39:16.824
it has nothing to do with you.

39:18.042 --> 39:19.402
It was my own decision.

39:25.875 --> 39:26.915
Actually,

39:28.174 --> 39:29.501
I have my own personal reason.

39:30.789 --> 39:31.789
I was thinking

39:32.749 --> 39:34.269
that when I had children,

39:35.951 --> 39:38.025
I could tell them proudly

39:40.203 --> 39:42.323
that I was the instructor of the best fire station,

39:44.163 --> 39:45.843
and I led the best firefighters.

40:10.953 --> 40:11.953
Salute!

41:02.038 --> 41:03.038
Down!

41:03.909 --> 41:04.909
Present the flag!

41:08.468 --> 41:10.429
Forward march!

41:21.303 --> 41:22.502
Halt!

41:23.648 --> 41:25.088
Mark time!

41:27.897 --> 41:28.897
Halt!

41:37.640 --> 41:39.040
I hereby announce

41:39.782 --> 41:41.661
that Suo Jun, the instructor

41:41.955 --> 41:43.569
of Shili Tai Fire and Rescue Station,

41:44.180 --> 41:45.500
will proudly retire

41:46.402 --> 41:49.768
from the national comprehensive fire and rescue team

41:50.319 --> 41:52.892
and transfer to the local housing and construction department.

41:53.689 --> 41:56.763
Thank you for your eight years of dedication

41:56.957 --> 41:58.694
to the construction of our fire brigade,

41:58.758 --> 42:01.349
safeguarding the lives and property of the people in Yanbei,

42:01.430 --> 42:03.231
and contributing actively

42:03.299 --> 42:05.225
to the fire safety in our jurisdiction.

42:05.816 --> 42:06.816
Today,

42:07.870 --> 42:10.109
even though you are leaving this team,

42:10.968 --> 42:13.048
this will always be your home.

42:13.682 --> 42:14.921
I hope you will

42:16.112 --> 42:17.753
visit often in the future.

42:18.403 --> 42:20.562
May you always stay true

42:21.396 --> 42:22.756
to your original aspiration

42:23.296 --> 42:25.429
and never forget your mission on your future path.

42:25.522 --> 42:27.203
-Suo Jun! -Yes, ma'am!

42:27.390 --> 42:29.182
-Step forward! -Yes, ma'am!
